('field-oersted-object','Ørsted compass needle, 1828 — Science Museum Group','https://collection.sciencemuseumgroup.org.uk/objects/co145363/oersted-compass-needle-1828','A surviving demonstration instrument, not a claim about a single dramatic discovery moment.'),
('field-oersted-observation',"Oersted’s experiment — Institute of Physics",'https://spark.iop.org/oersteds-experiment','Supports opposite compass directions above and below a current-carrying wire. Construction and power-supply instructions deliberately excluded.'),
